Firmware provenance
===================

private_include/gsl3680_firmware.h contains the original JC8012P4A1C controller
firmware table supplied with the local port. Its contents are unchanged.
No upstream license was supplied for this table; the component's MIT license
does not grant rights to it. Its owner's authorization is needed to relicense it.

The driver initialization sequence and panel calibration parameters retain
the behavior of the supplied port. The driver code, public API, examples,
tests and documentation are provided under LICENSE (MIT).
